  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T04:29:07.405682Z",
  "totalBlocks": 46,
  "translatedBlocks": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0f3ab2417f2e1763",
      "translationZh": "Anyscale 团队 Amog Kamsetty 的客座博文",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cc964c19747a837",
      "translationZh": "Huggingface Transformers 最近加入了检索增强生成（Retrieval Augmented Generation，RAG）模型——一种新的 NLP 架构，它借助外部文档（如 Wikipedia）来增强自身知识，在知识密集型任务上取得了最先进的结果。在这篇博文中，我们将介绍把 Ray（一个用于构建可扩展应用的库）集成进 RAG 的上下文文档检索机制。这将检索调用提速 2 倍，并改善了 RAG 分布式微调的可扩展性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53eb81a3fac85be3",
      "translationZh": "什么是检索增强生成（RAG）？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e80fb1a84afb598",
      "translationZh": "RAG 概览。模型在执行过程中会从外部数据集检索上下文文档，这些文档与原始输入一起用于产生输出。GIF 取自 Facebook 的原始博文。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12e9ee314fd21131",
      "translationZh": "最近，Huggingface 与 Facebook AI 合作，在 Transformers 库中引入了 RAG 模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2f1e034cfb3bc1a",
      "translationZh": "RAG 的行为与其他 seq2seq 模型一样。不过 RAG 有一个中间组件，会从外部知识库（如 Wikipedia 文本语料）检索上下文文档，然后把这些文档与输入序列一起送入底层的 seq2seq 生成器。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f695e0beb3e85f33",
      "translationZh": "这一信息检索步骤让 RAG 能够同时利用多个知识来源——既有固化在模型参数里的知识，也有上下文段落承载的信息——从而在问答等任务上超越其他最先进模型。你可以用 Huggingface 提供的这个演示亲自试试！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c367ca8d9e1e874e",
      "translationZh": "扩展微调规模",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d8ce421ac0a19fb",
      "translationZh": "上下文文档检索对 RAG 的最先进结果至关重要，但也引入了一层额外的复杂性。在通过数据并行训练流程放大训练规模时，朴素的文档查询实现可能成为训练瓶颈。此外，检索组件使用的文档索引往往非常庞大，让每个训练 worker 都各自加载一份索引副本并不现实。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e855a1e37e4540e",
      "translationZh": "此前 RAG 微调的实现使用 torch.distributed 通信包来处理文档检索部分，但这个实现有时显得不够灵活、可扩展性受限。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12b77a95381e5ffb",
      "translationZh": "我们需要的是一个框架无关、更灵活的特设并发编程实现，而 Ray 恰好完全符合要求。Ray 是一个简单却强大的 Python 库，面向通用分布式与并行编程。改用 Ray 做分布式文档检索后，每次检索调用相比 torch.distributed 提速 2 倍，整体微调可扩展性也更好。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b602f5b5b45f08e6",
      "translationZh": "用 Ray 做文档检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe5c0a130a2fff78",
      "translationZh": "torch.distributed 实现的文档检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc06e9f83a7b28dc",
      "translationZh": "torch.distributed 版文档检索的主要缺陷是：它绑定了与训练共用的同一进程组，而且只有 rank 0 训练 worker 把索引加载进内存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bfddd613dea5aa5",
      "translationZh": "因此这个实现有几个局限：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20477ca43d792abf",
      "translationZh": "同步瓶颈：rank 0 worker 要接收所有 worker 的输入、执行索引查询、再把结果发回其他 worker，多个训练 worker 时性能受限。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b398c42bc444661",
      "translationZh": "绑定 PyTorch：文档检索进程组必须挂靠训练已有的进程组，意味着训练也必须用 PyTorch。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66d9096a5fb5ac6d",
      "translationZh": "Ray 实现的文档检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64ac9da39f75ce6b",
      "translationZh": "为克服这些局限，我们提出了一种基于 Ray 的新型分布式检索实现。借助 Ray 的有状态 actor 抽象，由多个独立于训练进程的进程来加载索引并处理检索查询。有了多个 Ray actor，检索不再成为瓶颈，RAG 也不再强依赖 PyTorch。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4a91f6880416ca0",
      "translationZh": "如下方所示，基于 Ray 的实现在多 GPU 微调下检索性能更好。以下结果是每次检索调用的秒数：可以看到，随着训练所用 GPU 数量增加，Ray 相比 torch.distributed 表现更佳；而且如果增加执行检索的 Ray 进程数，训练 worker 更多时性能也更好，因为单个检索进程不再成为瓶颈。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "263423e085e2c426",
      "translationZh": "2 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "051b240328f92c8c",
      "translationZh": "3 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c56aeebdadaabf6",
      "translationZh": "4 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d9a5807f0529e0c",
      "translationZh": "torch.distributed",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec414e21dd14ca09",
      "translationZh": "2.12 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcc3955f0bff033f",
      "translationZh": "2.62 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fdce7419f551c16",
      "translationZh": "3.438 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c165bf0801788ca",
      "translationZh": "Ray 2 个检索进程",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbe29025fd90147b",
      "translationZh": "1.49 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38108f13ad37aca2",
      "translationZh": "1.539 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35944d98ac65633d",
      "translationZh": "2.029 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "138027ec030efc93",
      "translationZh": "Ray 4 个检索进程",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbce8c978251944a",
      "translationZh": "1.145 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a67f734e137f3bf",
      "translationZh": "1.484 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac646b55d1adbede",
      "translationZh": "1.66 秒/次检索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d75692e8bcb47fde",
      "translationZh": "不同检索实现的性能对比。对每种文档检索实现，我们运行 500 个训练步（每 GPU 批大小为 8），并测量 rank 0 训练 worker 为每个批次检索上下文文档所花的时间。结果表明，使用多个检索进程能改善性能，在把训练扩展到多 GPU 时尤其明显。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7753134adefdc471",
      "translationZh": "如何使用？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbc908a11fbfbb92",
      "translationZh": "Huggingface 提供了基于 PyTorch Lightning 的微调脚本，我们对其做了扩展，把 Ray 检索实现加入为可选项。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99a850d81a63bd9e",
      "translationZh": "要试用，先安装必要的依赖",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abf3f774dce9e0cc",
      "translationZh": "然后指定你的数据路径和其他配置，运行 finetune-rag-ray.sh！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7ad7aa27712dc30e",
      "translationZh": "接下来做什么？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfba8701f306b061",
      "translationZh": "配合 Huggingface transformers 与 Ray 检索实现来使用 RAG，获得更快的分布式微调，你就能在自己的知识密集型任务上用 RAG 做基于检索的生成。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21e166773b69c663",
      "translationZh": "此外，超参数调优是 transformer 微调的另一个环节，对准确率影响巨大。要做可扩展又简单的超参数调优，请看 Ray Tune 库。通过 Ray Tune 与 PyTorch Lightning 的集成，或与 Huggingface transformers 的内置集成，你可以跑实验为自己的 RAG 模型找到完美超参数。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c2c478c980987b8",
      "translationZh": "最后，请期待 Huggingface 上可能出现 RAG 的 Tensorflow 实现！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a698c199e87ba928",
      "translationZh": "如果你打算试用 RAG+Ray 集成，欢迎在 Ray Discourse 上分享你的体验，或加入 Ray 社区 Slack 继续讨论——我们很乐意听你的声音！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b847860073c56bac",
      "translationZh": "同时发布于 https://medium.com/distributed-computing-with-ray/retrieval-augmented-generation-with-huggingface-transformers-and-ray-b09b56161b1e",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
